message:
{{#is_alert}}
**{{value}} paid orders have had no fulfilment progress for more than 3 minutes.**

The storefront, payments and the order service are all healthy — the orders are simply not moving. The warehouse management system and the carrier produce no Datadog telemetry, so there is no failed span and no 5xx anywhere to alert on. This monitor watches the AGE OF THE LAST HOP in the Carto transaction ledger instead, which is only possible because every hop is stamped with a Carto-minted `txn_id`.

Find the affected transactions: ${WEB_URL}/track — or in Datadog, `@observability:blackbox` in Logs.
{{/is_alert}}
